## PR Title
Compact rcf

## PR Description

*Description of changes:* Links up float[] for compact trees and also allows for bounding boxed to not be cached. The arrays in NodeStore/LeafStore are now behind interfaces and not accessed directly. The logic for add point is also refactored.




