## PR Title
Long range bot pathfinding

## PR Description
This certainly isn't an "agile" feature.

Attempts to enhance the bot's capabilities regarding long-range movement. The basic goal is to:
- Get the bot to stop getting stuck in cul-de-sacs when traveling across the map
- If destroying some terrain would open a path to where it's going, give the bot the capability to do so

Additional incidental features:
- Allow the bot to designate hexes as strategic targets and destroy them
- Performance improvements across the board, caching expensive values that are frequently re-computed
- An explicit behavioral control system for units, which can probably be expanded upon in the future
- I'll leave more notes here as I remember what else I did

