## PR Title
Migrate to third-party protoreflect.

## PR Description
This PR migrates the linter to the third-party protoreflect package, as well as migrates existing rules.
Additionally, it moves rules into their own packages and changes up their organization a little bit.

Worth noting that this also removes the requirement for a git submodule, and in fact removes the dependency on having protoc at all (although it can still run as a protoc plugin, of course).

