With the introduction of xml sitemaps a couple of implicit requirements needed to be implemented: 

- sitemaps should not include pages, which robots meta tag is set to noindex
- sitemaps should include the canonical urls of pages 
- when available sitemaps should include language alternates

This ticket is about adding the information now available to sitemaps to the page's head.

