## PR Title
capa cluster templating

## PR Description
We now have giant swarm release `v.20.0.0` for aws that uses the upstream CAPI and CAPA controllers. This version is a test version that is currently used internally. This PR adds templating for Clusters and Machinepools in this version to `kubectl-gs` so that our teams can create test clusters more easily.
The templates are directly pulled from upstream but we add our labels, cross account management and (most of) the options currently supported in `kubectl-gs`. The templates need to still be defauled by `kyverno` when they are applied.

Towards https://github.com/giantswarm/giantswarm/issues/17831

