## Description

This PR provides my initial contribution to the QueryDSL integration. This extends QueryDSL's API so that queries can be executed through Blaze-Persist, making its rich feature set available to QueryDSL domains.

The implementation is tested through integration tests which are derived from similar existing test scenarios. The implementation is also battle-tested in one of my projects for which I now run all QueryDSL queries through this integration.

*I have not abandoned my work on the fluent API version that is supposed to come in a separate module. However, due to time constraints (this PR is already taking much longer than I wanted to - if been working on this on and off since late December...), I am forced to prioritize. I really rather work on the metamodel changes required for
 Hibernate Composite User Type and JSON path dereference support first. As the point when I get back to it, we may already have the static metamodel in BP itself which also decreases its value relatively.*


<!--- Give an overview of what you changed -->

## Related Issue
Fixes #1070
