## Motivation and Context

From the original issue:

> A lot of projects use QueryDSL for generating JPQL/HQL queries, rather than dealing with the Criteria API or JPQL directly. For this userbase, dealing with the CriteriaBuilder API may not be so straightforward. A lot of QueryDSL users also face the limitations of plain JPQL/JPA, so it would be great to introduce this user base to the rich feature set of Blaze-Persistence. This integration allows a smooth transition for existing QueryDSL users to Blaze-Persistence.


