## PR Title
[A2-771] AuthorizedProjects handles deny

## PR Description
### :nut_and_bolt: Description
This PR refines the rego behind ProjectsAuthorized to ensure a deny overrides an allow on the same project, even with statements containing `All-Projects`

### :+1: Definition of Done

- [x] when request includes projects and statement denies all projects, ProjectsAuthorized returns no projects
- [x] when request includes no projects and statement denies all projects, ProjectsAuthorized returns no projects
- [x] when request includes no projects and one statement allows all projects and another statement denies one project, authz-service returns a list of all projects minus the denied projects

### :athletic_shoe: Demo Script / Repro Steps

1. rebuild services  and make some projects, teams, and roles
```
rebuild components/authz-service

export TOK=`chef-automate iam token create ADMIN --admin`
curl -kH "api-token: $TOK" -d '{"name":"project 1", "id": "p1"}' https://a2-dev.test/apis/iam/v2beta/projects | jq
curl -kH "api-token: $TOK" -d '{"name":"project 2", "id": "p2"}' https://a2-dev.test/apis/iam/v2beta/projects | jq

curl -kH "api-token: $TOK" -d '{"name":"role 1", "id": "r1", "actions": ["do:the:thing"], "projects": ["p1"]}' https://a2-dev.test/apis/iam/v2beta/roles | jq
curl -kH "api-token: $TOK" -d '{"name":"role 2", "id": "r2", "actions": ["do:the:thing"], "projects": ["p2"]}' https://a2-dev.test/apis/iam/v2beta/roles | jq

curl -kH "api-token: $TOK" -d '{"name":"team 2", "id": "t2", "projects": ["p2"]}' https://a2-dev.test/apis/iam/v2beta/teams | jq
```

2. upgrade to 2.1 and make a test token
```
chef-automate iam upgrade-to-v2 --beta2.1
export TEST=`chef-automate iam token create test`
```

3. make a policy for that token
```
# save as policy.json
{
  "name": "testing deny",
  "id": "test",
  "members": [ "token:test" ],
  "statements": [
    {
      "effect": "DENY",
      "actions": [ "iam:teams:list" ],
      "projects": [ "*" ]
    },
