## PR Title
Refactor: x/cert certificate

## PR Description
<!-- < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < ☺
v                               ✰  Thanks for creating a PR! ✰    
v    Before smashing the submit button please review the checkboxes.
v    If a checkbox is n/a - please still include it but + a little note why
☺ > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > >  -->

Closes: #246, #256

## Description

* Removed TxHash field from certificate types. 
* Changed type of certificate id to uint64 and introduced consecutive id assignment (like shield pool id). 
* Refactored certificate content to interface. 
* Removed CertType field from certificate types and Type() from the interface. 
* Removed content and content type from certificates query filter and replaced with certificate type. 
* Rmoved certificate ContentType. 
* Merged two certificate types (general and compilation) into one. 
