## PR Title
census: allow using values (in addition to keys)

## PR Description
Until now only keys were allowed to be used as part of the census merkle
tree. This commit introduces also values, which are stored as a leaf of
the census tree. The values do not change the position of the claim into
the merkle tree, its aim is to be used as a numeric weight.

This is the first step to support weighted elections.

WARNING: API breaking change

Signed-off-by: p4u <pau@dabax.net>

