## PR Title
Remote restore support for Medusa

## PR Description
<!--  Thanks for sending a pull request!  Before submitting:

1. Read our CONTRIBUTING.md guide
2. Rebase your PR if it gets out of sync with main
-->

**What this PR does**:
Allow restoring a backup from another cluster (including backups created with Medusa outside of K8ssandra).
Requires these medusa PR to be merged first, and a Medusa release so that we can update the tag for the medusa image: [448](https://github.com/thelastpickle/cassandra-medusa/pull/448) and [449](https://github.com/thelastpickle/cassandra-medusa/pull/449).

The design is fully documented in `docs/medusa/remote-restore-design.md`.

**Which issue(s) this PR fixes**:
Fixes #450
Fixes #451 
Fixes #452 

