## PR Title
Gpu plugin testing improvements

## PR Description
This adds better GPU plugin functionality unit testing coverage, and fixes few minor issues the new tests revealed in the plugin & its test code.  Fix commits are before testing updates so that all commits pass existing tests. Copyright is also updated suitably.

EDIT:  removed this part as we couldn't agree on how it should be implemented: "Testing of command line options was missing earlier. Adding that will also help in minimizing testing changes for future pull requests."


