## PR Title
[feature] Epoch syncing - syncing only epoch blocks

## PR Description
## For S1/2/3 node runner: 
This feature is only applicable for S1/2/3 validator and explorer node. it will reduce the need of the shard 0 DB today from >2TB to few hundred MB

After the PR has been installed, it's recommended to delete the shard 0 DB on the s1/2/3 validator/explorer node so the epoch blocks can be downloaded.

## Issue
Optimize beacon chain sync by only syncing the epoch blocks. 
https://github.com/harmony-one/harmony/issues/4052

