## PR Title
test(plugin-meetings): converged meetings testing users

## PR Description
# Description

The scope of the changes in this pull request are to add the necessary test to validate if a converged organization operates as expected when used within the `meetings` plugin. The changes include source changes amending the `roapConnectionService` as a key to the `meeting.mediaProperties.webrtcMediaConnection` object for reference in both tests, debugging, and conditional reactions.

**NOTE** - The ENV variable `WEBEX_CONVERGED_ORG_ID` must be set in order for this tests to operate as expected.

## Links

[JIRA](https://jira-eng-gpk2.cisco.com/jira/browse/SPARK-385748).

