## PR Title
Feature/preferences http handler

## PR Description
Preferences HTTP Handler and test cases.
- Preferences (Map<String, String>) can be retrieved/stored/deleted at Instance Level, Namespace Level, Application Level, Program Level. 
- Preferences at each level can also be retrieved with resolved mode, in which case the preferences from all the levels above will be collapsed and a unified map will be returned (finer granularity takes precedence).
- Preferences cannot be set for Applications that are deployed or running. 
- Preferences can be accessed through ProgramContext through getRuntimeArguments method.

